WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:17.980
and his companions ran back down the mountain, escaping the fire.

2
00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:24.602
Boy's fire is powerful," said the monkey.

3
00:00:24.622 --> 00:00:26.683
"We were nearly roasted!"

4
00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:27.703
said Bajie.

5
00:00:29.564 --> 00:00:31.024
looked up at the mountain peak.

6
00:00:32.152 --> 00:00:33.813
"The fire is dying down now."

7
00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:39.195
"Yes," said Wukong, looking at the last few wisps of smoke.

8
00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:43.077
"But he'll use it again if we go back up there."

9
00:00:43.097 --> 00:00:46.258
"We need water," said Wujing.

10
00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:49.920
"Then if he makes fire again, we can just put it out."

11
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.441
nodded. "You two wait here.

12
00:00:54.202 --> 00:00:55.182
I know who can help us."

13
00:00:57.183 --> 00:00:59.624
The monkey shot into the air and flew away.

14
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:06.823
When he returned, the Dragon King of the Eastern Sea was with him.

15
00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:12.006
Wukong introduced the Dragon King to Bajie and Wujing.

16
00:01:12.026 --> 00:01:17.150
"I can summon rain clouds," said the Dragon King.

17
00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:21.873
"Go back up the mountain, and get Red Boy to come out.

18
00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:27.677
As soon as he makes his fire, I'll create a huge rainstorm."

19
00:01:28.698 --> 00:01:31.220
The Dragon King flew up into the sky.

20
00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.381
Wukong and the others returned to the cave.

21
00:01:36.882 --> 00:01:37.843
up, Red Boy!"

22
00:01:38.423 --> 00:01:40.304
The monkey pounded on the cave door.

23
00:01:42.085 --> 00:01:44.967
The door flew open and Red Boy ran outside.

24
00:01:44.987 --> 00:01:48.309
"Release the Tang Monk right now!"

25
00:01:48.629 --> 00:01:49.569
shouted Wukong.

26
00:01:49.589 --> 00:01:52.831
"Never!" shouted the demon.

27
00:01:53.692 --> 00:01:55.973
He made a fist and punched himself in the nose.

28
00:01:58.094 --> 00:02:00.396
Smoke and fire poured from his face again.

29
00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:03.920
"Dragon King!"

30
00:02:04.161 --> 00:02:04.901
called the monkey.

31
00:02:04.921 --> 00:02:06.942
"Make it rain!"

32
00:02:08.923 --> 00:02:11.204
rumbled as dark clouds filled the sky.

33
00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:13.204
Rain poured down.

34
00:02:13.985 --> 00:02:15.806
The fire, however, didn't go out.

35
00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:19.907
it grew—bigger and bigger.

36
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.388
The smoke became thick.

37
00:02:23.129 --> 00:02:27.051
Coughing and unable to breathe, Wukong covered his face.

38
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:30.132
He saw Bajie and Wujing running away.

39
00:02:31.552 --> 00:02:35.175
The monkey tried to get to the cave door, but the smoke was too thick.

40
00:02:36.176 --> 00:02:39.538
He tripped on a rock and tumbled down the side of the mountain.

41
00:02:46.624 --> 00:02:49.306
Wukong landed in a river and floated downstream.

42
00:02:52.689 --> 00:02:56.432
Finally he washed up on the riverbank, coughing and wheezing.

43
00:02:59.204 --> 00:03:01.606
Bajie and Wujing rushed over to the monkey.

44
00:03:01.626 --> 00:03:04.007
"Wukong, are you all right?"

45
00:03:04.347 --> 00:03:05.108
asked Wujing.

46
00:03:06.829 --> 00:03:08.430
think so," said the monkey.

47
00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:09.831
He coughed again.

48
00:03:11.472 --> 00:03:13.273
fire is no ordinary fire.

49
00:03:14.053 --> 00:03:15.374
The water made it worse."

50
00:03:15.474 --> 00:03:17.935
"You're right," said the pig.

51
00:03:17.955 --> 00:03:19.957
"It must be magic fire.

52
00:03:20.897 --> 00:03:21.798
will we do now?

53
00:03:23.038 --> 00:03:27.740
Red Boy still has the Tang Monk in his cave."

54
00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.901
"I'll ask Guanyin for help," said Wukong, standing up.

55
00:03:31.801 --> 00:03:33.522
"You rest," said Bajie.

56
00:03:34.402 --> 00:03:35.603
breathed in a lot of smoke.

57
00:03:36.203 --> 00:03:37.143
I'll go to Guanyin."

58
00:03:38.263 --> 00:03:39.364
The monkey coughed again.

59
00:03:39.384 --> 00:03:41.664
"Okay, Bajie.

60
00:03:42.745 --> 00:03:44.345
But go straight to Guanyin.

61
00:03:45.026 --> 00:03:47.406
No naps!"

62
00:03:49.707 --> 00:03:52.648
Meanwhile Red Boy was sitting on his mountain peak.

63
00:03:53.876 --> 00:03:58.139
"My fire was too powerful for Sun Wukong and his friends," he said to himself.

64
00:03:58.159 --> 00:04:00.481
"They must be dead now."

65
00:04:01.941 --> 00:04:03.342
demon patted his belly.

66
00:04:03.362 --> 00:04:07.205
"And that is good because I am hungry.

67
00:04:08.046 --> 00:04:10.467
I'll go inside now and start cooking the Tang Monk."

68
00:04:11.988 --> 00:04:15.531
The demon stood up to leave when he spotted something in the sky.

69
00:04:15.551 --> 00:04:18.973
"It's the pig!"

70
00:04:19.193 --> 00:04:19.673
he said.

71
00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:21.134
heading south.

72
00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:25.472
I wonder why."

73
00:04:25.552 --> 00:04:27.033
Red Boy thought for a minute.

74
00:04:28.595 --> 00:04:33.899
"Aha! The bodhisattva Guanyin lives on Mount Potalaka, in the South Sea.

75
00:04:35.581 --> 00:04:37.562
pig must be going to ask her for help.

76
00:04:38.723 --> 00:04:39.604
I'll stop him!"

77
00:04:41.005 --> 00:04:45.048
The demon recited a quick spell, and light sparkled around him.

78
00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.272
Now Red Boy looked exactly like Guanyin.

79
00:04:51.714 --> 00:04:53.876
Bajie soared through the sky on his cloud.

80
00:04:58.592 --> 00:05:00.333
He saw Guanyin coming toward him.

81
00:05:00.353 --> 00:05:03.436
"Bodhisattva!" cried the pig with a smile.

82
00:05:06.078 --> 00:05:06.838
is a surprise.

83
00:05:07.299 --> 00:05:08.200
I was just coming to see
